Control: receive drops the first change frame of every transaction and does not count it. Must fail: the count of changes per index record of cdc-copy-multi-insert, on the first COPY it checks.
Apply from the repository root with git apply, and never commit it applied.

diff --git a/src/bin/pgcopydb/ld_spool.c b/src/bin/pgcopydb/ld_spool.c
